From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 20:53:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf(rfork): log model load stage timing

Add timing hooks for default loader weight loading and post-load processing so RFork fallback and disk-loading paths can be compared against successful RFork transfers.

Also log model runner stage totals for main model loading, drafter loading, offloader initialization, graph wrapping, and remaining load_model overhead.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
